    "html": "<p>The following table shows the melting and boiling points of different substances:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Substance</th><th>Melting Point (°C)</th><th>Boiling Point (°C)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-label=\"A\"><td>A</td><td>-10</td><td>80</td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td>B</td><td>0</td><td>100</td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td>C</td><td>200</td><td>900</td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td>D</td><td>-200</td><td>-180</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>At a temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-5^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}\"></span> and standard atmospheric pressure, which substance will be in the liquid phase?</p>"
